cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "Portfolio, by Hemrock"
abstract: >-
  Open-source fund administration, portfolio monitoring and LP reporting for small venture funds:
  double-entry books for every entity, partner capital accounts, LP statements, letters and a portal,
  diligence and memo drafting, and an MCP server so Claude, ChatGPT and other agents can work with a
  fund's own data. Self-hosted on Supabase and Vercel or Netlify.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Taylor
    family-names: Davidson
    affiliation: Hemrock
repository-code: "https://github.com/tdavidson/portfolio"
url: "https://www.hemrock.com/portfolio"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - venture capital
  - fund administration
  - fund accounting
  - LP reporting
  - portfolio monitoring
  - MCP
  - self-hosted
